    "html": "<p>A horizontal jet of water is directed at a vertical wall. The water strikes the wall at a constant rate of <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"1.8 \\ \\mathrm{kg}\\ \\mathrm{s}^{-1}\"></span> with a speed of <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"25\\ \\mathrm{m} \\ \\mathrm{s}^{-1}\"></span>.</p>\n<p>Upon striking the wall, the water loses all of its horizontal momentum and flows vertically downwards. What is the average force exerted by the water on the wall?</p><ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\"><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"14\\ \\mathrm{N}\"></span></p></li><li data-label=\"B\"><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"45\\ \\mathrm{N}\"></span></p></li><li data-label=\"C\"><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"63 \\ \\mathrm{N}\"></span></p></li><li data-label=\"D\"><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"90\\ \\mathrm{N}\"></span></p></li></ol>"
